"__typename": "Application", "id": "2104963472963790", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28103898372643611"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "342426533354591"}]}, "change_log": "v1.6.0.2 Hotfix Now Live\n\nHey, Action Heroes! \n\nWe\u2019ve released a small update to address some issues affecting Remixes. Thank you for your feedback and help with calling out these issues. For assistance or to report any other issues or bugs, feel free to reach out to the team on our Support Page or join us on Discord. \n\nPistol Whip v1.6.0.2 Changelog: \n\nThe following fixes have been made: \nTween scripts no longer break when system locale uses commas rather than full stops as decimal separator \nRemix downloading now works as intended (Download progress is shown correctly and Play button will be enabled when downloading is complete). \nGlow lobby now shows correctly defined colour \nAdded glow to enemy guns before shooting in Remixes \nAdded a search function in Remixes\nFlyingSkull Short sequence functions properly \nProp names are now uniquely identified with levels \nFixed 5+ minutes tag\nSideloaded remixes no longer limited to 10 \n", "created_date": 1790288516, "id": "28103898372643611", "version": "1.6.0.2", "version_code": 2105, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28103895129310602"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2104963472963790", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28103898372643611"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1765541196, "id": "2501321536171194